antly I want to inspire every  single one of you to do something to  help a child in your life in fact I'd  like you to take a moment right now just  to think through what you can do to help  kids what will be your Connor moment I'm  not going to stand up here and suggest  what's a big thing for you or what's a  little thing we're just be is there are  alumni in here they're successful  professionals in here you're all doing  great things and we'll go on to do even  bigger things if you want to donate to  an organization well I think my  peninsula bridge board and fellow our  board members and directors wouldn't  forgive me if I didn't give them a bed  of Prague so Peninsula bridge dog people  or it could be something as small as  calling your niece or nephew that you  haven't spoken to in a while I know that  over the last 12 minutes that I've been  rambling up here something has come up  in your mind about what you can do to  help kids in your life the  she knows what are you waiting for thank  you
 

